Pins the language the same way in every harness, 119 of them across 39 files, all the same line right after the app is built. The comment in `system_lang` now says why the harnesses have to do it, so the next one copied from an existing test keeps the line rather than quietly depending on the developer's locale.

The tests go on reading the shell by its English labels, which is the right thing for them to do — `tests/control.rs` is the one that checks labels change with the language, and it asks the catalog for them.

