*Reworked on 2026-11-10 after #6100. #6100 now lists the paper sizes a Windows driver reports and starts on its default, and #6779 keeps each printer's paper, so this PR's earlier dialog and `doc_print` changes are dropped. What remains is the part #6100 leaves empty: CUPS. The earlier version is in this branch's history.*

